(b) One member shall be selected from time to time by the governing authority of Tift County for an initial term expiring December 31, 1992, and five year terms thereafter with such position to be designated as County Post Number Two;
(c) One member shall be selected from time to time by the governing authority of Tift County for an initial term expiring December 31, 1992, and five year terms thereafter with such position to be designated as County Post Number Three;
(d) One member shall be selected from time to time by the governing authority of Tift County for an initial term expiring December 31, 1994, and five year terms thereafter with such position to be designated as County Post Number Four;
(e) One member shall be selected from time to time by the governing authority of Tift County for an initial term expiring December 31, 1995, and five year terms thereafter with such position to be designated as County Post Number Five;
(f) One member shall be selected from time to time by the governing authority of the City of Tifton for an initial term expiring December 31, 1991, and five year terms thereafter with such position to be designated as Tifton Post Number One;
